# Performance — {{ project_name }}

## Budgets (adjust per project)
- LCP < 2.5s on key pages
- CLS < 0.1
- INP < 200ms

## Practices
- Lazy-load heavy client components
- Optimise images; avoid layout shift
- Avoid unnecessary re-renders and N+1 API calls
- Measure before optimising — profile, do not guess

## Before release
- Run production build: `{{ commands.build }}`
- Smoke-test critical flows on throttled network if possible
